.TH AVR\-SBOM\-VIEW 1 "" "avr 0.4.1" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-sbom-view \- Show an SBOM's summary: dependency counts, licences, and artifacts.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr sbom view
[OPTIONS] [COMMIT]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show an SBOM's summary: dependency counts, licences, and artifacts.
.PP
COMMIT is the commit of a recorded SBOM, as a full SHA or a unique prefix of at least 7 characters such as the one `avr sbom list` shows. Defaults to the latest SBOM.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr sbom view --repo acme/api
    avr sbom view 3f2c9a1b7d04 --repo acme/api
    avr sbom view --repo acme/api --json summary --jq .summary.licenses
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    artifacts, branch, commit_sha, generated_at, is_release, recorded_at,
    schema_version, summary
.fi
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
[\fICOMMIT\fR]
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Repository (org/repo or rep-xxx). Auto-detected from git remote if omitted.
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-commit\fR \fITEXT\fR
Same as the COMMIT argument.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-sbom (1),
.BR avr-sbom-download (1),
.BR avr-sbom-generate (1),
.BR avr-sbom-list (1)
